        <mxCell id="notes" value="Source: repository code + docs/ARCHITECTURE.md + deploy/README.md (2026-10-07). Phase 8 deployment owner-confirmed 2026-10-02; live AWS state not inspected.&lt;br/&gt;EC2 Region/AZ, VPC, subnet and Security Group details are not recorded. S3 us-east-1 is the configured Region. Steam is not implemented.&lt;br/&gt;DLM snapshot configuration is described in the runbook; the deployed policy/schedule is unverified. EBS snapshots do not include S3 image contents." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
